W: 1. Hang down your head, Tom Smothers,
W: Hang down your head and swear,
W: Hang down your head Tom Smothers,
W: You're off the air.
W:
W: 2. I went up to your censor,
W: To see what I could do,
W: I said, "Please help Tom Smothers,
W: He said to me, "F*** you!"
W:
W: 3. They said they would replace you,
W: Your humor was too raw,
W: And now I feel so sorry,
W: I have to watch "Hee-Haw."
